  noteTitle: Dusty Note
  noteItemModel: {fileID: 3164688655149136121, guid: 8afb0c280bcbdca42bd4c61cbec40813,
    type: 3}
  notePages:
  - In an attempt to try to help the current situation. I decided to completely lock
    down the lower levels.
  - The stairway is already blocked from the organism so the only way up is the <b>Boiler
    Room</b> emergency ladderway.
  - So if you are <b>alive</b> and reading this, that is the only way out to the
    higher floors.
  - "First you need to get into Lower Administration. It's just past the door I\u2019m
    putting this note on, and get the <b>Pull Down Hook</b>. I put it in <b>Joan's
    Office</b>. You're going to need it to pull down the emergency ladder."
  - I locked up <b>Lower Administration</b> so first grab the key from the <b>Boiler
    Workshop.</b>
  - May God help us all.
  - '- Jackson'
